    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "Family Day at Guildhall Art Gallery",
            "paragraphs": [
                "We want Open House to be easy for everyone to enjoy, young and old.",
                "Head to Guildhall Art Gallery and London’s Roman Amphitheatre on 12 September for an Open House experience made just for families.",
                "Inside the Gallery you and your little ones will be able to become real-life builders, create Lego landscapes, and join the Insurance Museum to make your own Fire Mark.",
                "Then pick up a map or join the walking bus to three more City sites with family offers on the same day – London Mithraeum Bloomberg SPACE, St Paul’s Cathedral and Dr Johnson’s House.",
